      "created_at": "2015-11-26T07:35:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Played lots of neat board games some of which aren't even released?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not what I was thinking of, but I did do that. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>I got to play Spirit Island with Eric and Sqgl, which was really cool!</p>\n<p>And Tiny Epic Western is a great little game, definitely look out for that one.</p>",
